From 446a75458fc3ad2a608582ddeee43c8570100a3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julian Cooper <115541810+Juliansgith@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:12:40 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 08/56] Port FAF engine functions that FAF's Lua calls

FAF's Lua (game version 3839) calls engine functions that FA-Binary-Patches
adds. Missing, they raised "attempt to call" errors:

- SetCommandSource / SetFocusArmy in the sim lane: the recovered bodies
  existed but were never registered there (victory conditions and
  abandoned-army handling call them).
- GetDepositsAroundPoint in the sim and user lanes, with FAF's field names
  (X1, Z1, X2, Z2, Type, Dist).
- SetNavigatorPersonalPosMaxDistance: FAF's hook at 0x005AF8D5 turns
  CAiPathNavigator's fixed 50.0 string-pull limit into a variable.
- Projectile:GetMaxZigZag, GetZigZagFrequency, GetCurrentTargetPositionXYZ
  and SetNewTargetGroundXYZ.
- Unit:ForceAltFootprint, which sets the second alt-footprint flag
  Entity::GetFootprint already honours.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit 0bdb1efc4c2f6535bd7b08af627dbc92f3e953a8)
